							<p class="plenary-title">Growing hybrid intelligence through Evidence-Based eXplainable AI - grounding AI interventions within socio-technical settings on empirical research </p>
							<h4 class="plenary-names"><a href="#">Federico Cabitza</a></h4>
							<p class="plenary-institution">
							University of  Milano-Bicocca, Milan, Italy
							</p>
